            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You possess celestial magic. Choose two of the following spells: clear mind, everlight, humanoid form, revealing light, share life, or sure footing. You can use each of the chosen spells once per day as 2nd-rank divine innate spells.\n\nAngelkin typically take clear mind and humanoid form, lawbringers typically have everlight and share life, and musetouched typically have revealing light and sure footing."
            }
          }
        }
